  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Slower walking, knee pain on stairs and one near-fall in the past six months, found on the comprehensive geriatric assessment at intake: gait speed 0.78 m/s, Timed Up and Go 13.8 seconds, unable to hold a tandem stance for 10 seconds, grip 24 kg; cause under evaluation with a geriatric medicine consultation</td><td>resolved</td><td>confirmed</td>
